+   This surface carried its own hardcoded green palette (#17624b / #fbfdfb / #12383b)
+   that existed only in the light theme, so on the dark canvas it painted a mint
+   island and a white slab.  It now reads the shared tokens; green survives only
+   where it means something (a truth/protected marker), not as decoration. */
+.v10-execution-panel { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 34px)); margin: 0 auto 18px; padding: var(--cn-s-20); border: 1px solid var(--cn-hairline); border-radius: var(--cn-r-card); background: var(--v8-panel); box-shadow: var(--cn-shadow-card); }
